       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TURTLE-QUANT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TURTLE-QUANT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-TURTLE-STEER-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-QUANTEL-MATTE-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PEN-GATING-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRAPHICS-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRAPHICS-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TURTLE-QUANT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PQT-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PQT-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TURTLE-AND-QUANTEL.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PEN-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PQT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-TURTLE-AND-QUANTEL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TURTLE-STEER-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-QUANTEL-MATTE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-PEN-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PEN-GATING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GRAPHICS-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PQT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-TURTLE-STEER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-QUANTEL-MATTE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PEN-GATING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GRAPHICS-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GRAPHICS-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PQT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PQT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PQT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PQT-CODE.
